  "notes": "{埋|う}まる is an intransitive godan verb meaning to be buried or filled.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {埋|う}まる (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧): to be buried/filled\n- ⟦{埋|う}める→埋める：01901_umeru⟧ (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧): to bury/fill\n\nPHYSICAL BURIAL:\n- ⟦{雪|ゆき}→雪：00584_yuki⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{埋|う}まる: to be buried in snow\n- ⟦{砂|すな}→砂：00890_suna⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{埋|う}まる: to be buried in sand\n- ⟦{落|お}ち{葉|ば}→落ち葉：14108_ochiba⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{埋|う}まる: to be covered in fallen leaves\n\nFIGURATIVE (filled up):\n- ⟦{席|せき}→席：02215_seki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{埋|う}まる: seats fill up\n- ⟦{予定|よてい}→予定：00824_yotei⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{埋|う}まる: schedule fills up\n- ⟦{空白|くうはく}→空白：15426_kuuhaku⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{埋|う}まる: gaps get filled\n- ⟦{穴|あな}→穴：01691_ana⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{埋|う}まる: holes get filled\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{埋|う}め{立|た}てる→埋め立てる：27788_umetateru⟧: to reclaim land (by filling)\n- ⟦{埋|まい}{蔵|ぞう}→埋蔵：noentry⟧: buried (treasure, resources)",
